        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Ekigambo kya Mukama ekyajjira Zeffaniya mutabani wa Kuusi, muzzukulu wa Gedaliya, muzzukulu wa Amaliya, muzzukulu wa Keezeekiya, mu mirembe gya Yosiya mutabani wa Amoni, Kabaka wa Yuda.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a5f7e4909dcafd47a92",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "“Ndizikiririza ddala byonna okuva ku nsi,” bw’ayogera Mukama.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a5f7e4909dcafd47ae2",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "“Ndizikiriza abantu wamu n’ensolo;\n    ndizikiriza ebinyonyi eby’omu bbanga\n    n’ebyennyanja;\n  ababi balisigaza ntuumu ya kafakalimbo;\n    bwe ndimalawo abantu okuva ku nsi,”\n    bw’ayogera Mukama.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a5f7e4909dcafd47af2",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Ndigololera ku Yuda omukono gwange,\n    era ne ku abo bonna abali mu Yerusaalemi;\n  era ekitundu kya Baali ekifisseewo n’ennyumba ya Bakemali,\n    bakabona abasinza ebifaananyi, ndibazikiriza okuva mu kifo kino,",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a5f7e4909dcafd47b29",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "abo abavuunamira eggye ery’omu ggulu\n    ku nnyumba waggulu,\n  ne balisinza n’abo abalayira mu linnya lya Mukama,\n    ate nga balayira ne mu linnya lya Malukamu,",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47b5d",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "abo abadda emabega obutagoberera Mukama,\n    wadde abo abatamunoonya newaakubadde okumwebuuzaako.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47bb9",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Siriikirira awali Mukama Katonda,\n    kubanga olunaku lwa Mukama luli kumpi.\n  Mukama ategese ssaddaaka,\n    era atukuzizza abagenyi be.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47bd6",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Ku lunaku olwa ssaddaaka ya Mukama,\n    ndibonereza abakungu\n    n’abaana ba Kabaka,\n  n’abo bonna abambadde\n    ebyambalo ebitasaana.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47c13",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Awo ku lunaku olwo ndibonereza\n    abo bonna abeewala okulinnya ku muziziko,\n  n’abo abajjuza ennyumba ya Mukama waabwe\n    ebikolwa eby’obukambwe n’obulimba.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47c3f",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Ku lunaku olwo, bw’ayogera Mukama,\n    eddoboozi ery’okukaaba liriwulikika ku Mulyango ogw’Ebyennyanja,\n    okukaaba okuva ku luuyi olwokubiri,\n    n’okubwatuka okunene okuva ku nsozi.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47c7c",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Mwekaabireko, mmwe abali mu matwale g’akatale;\n    abasuubuzi bammwe bonna zibasanze,\n    n’abo abeebinika ffeeza balizikirizibwa.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47cd1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Awo olulituuka mu biro ebyo ndimulisa Yerusaalemi n’ettabaaza nga nnoonya,\n    mbonereze abo bonna abalagajjavu\n    abali ng’omwenge ogutanasengejjebwa,\n  abalowooza nti Mukama\n    talibaako ne ky’akolawo.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47d3f",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Obugagga bwabwe bulinyagibwa,\n    n’ennyumba zaabwe zimenyebwemenyebwe.\n  Ne bwe balizimba ennyumba\n    tebalizituulamu,\n  era balisimba ennimiro ez’emizabbibu nazo\n    tebalinywa wayini wamu.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47d8b",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Olunaku lwa Mukama olukulu luli kumpi;\n    ddala lunaatera okutuuka.\n  Wuliriza! Omulwanyi alikaabira eyo ng’aliko obuyinike bungi,\n    n’okukaaba ku lunaku lwa Mukama kujja kuba kungi nnyo.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47df5",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Olunaku olwo lunaku lwa busungu,\n    lunaku lwa buyinike n’okulaba ennaku,\n  lunaku lwa mutawaana n’okuzikirira,\n    olunaku olw’ekikome n’ekizikiza,\n    olunaku lw’ebire n’ekizikiza ekikutte ennyo;",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47e57",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "olunaku olw’okufuuwa ekkondeere n’okulangirira olutalo\n    ku bibuga ebiriko ebigo\n    n’eri eminaala emigulumivu.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a607e4909dcafd47eb5",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Ndireeta, obuyinike ku bantu,\n    batambule ng’abazibe b’amaaso,\n    kubanga bakoze ebibi mu maaso ga Mukama,\n  omusaayi gwabwe guliyiyibwa ng’enfuufu,\n    n’ebyenda byabwe bivundire kungulu.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a617e4909dcafd47f19",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.1.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3cea1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.1",
        "content": "Effeeza yaabwe ne zaabu yaabwe\n    tebiriyinza kubataasa\n    ku lunaku olw’obusungu bwa Mukama.\n    \n  Ensi yonna erizikirizibwa\n    omuliro gw’obuggya bwe,\n  era alimalirawo ddala\n    abo bonna abali mu nsi.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 1:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.1.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a617e4909dcafd48047",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Mukuŋŋaane, weewaawo, mukuŋŋaane,\n    mmwe eggwanga eritalina nsonyi,",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a617e4909dcafd4808a",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "ekiseera ekyategekebwa nga tekinnatuuka,\n    olunaku ne luba ng’ebisusunku ebifuumulibwa,\n  obusungu bwa Mukama nga tebunnabatuukako,\n    ng’olunaku olw’obusungu bwa Mukama terunnabatuukako.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a617e4909dcafd48110",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
