        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Munoonye Mukama, mmwe mwenna abawombeefu ab’omu nsi,\n    abakola by’alagira;\n  munoonye obutuukirivu n’obuwombeefu;\n    mpozzi mulikwekebwa\n    ku lunaku olw’obusungu bwe.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a617e4909dcafd4818b",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Gaza kirirekebwawo,\n    ne Asukulooni kiriba matongo:\n  abantu ba Asudodi baligobebwamu mu ttuntu,\n    ne Ekuloni kirisimbulibwa.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a617e4909dcafd481e7",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Zibasanze mmwe ababeera ku lubalama lw’ennyanja,\n    eggwanga ery’Abakeresi!\n  Ekigambo kya Mukama kikwolekedde,\n    ggwe Kanani, ensi ey’Abafirisuuti.\n  Ndikuzikiriza\n    so tewaliba asigalawo.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a617e4909dcafd4824c",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Olubalama lw’ennyanja ab’Akeresi gye babeera\n    luliba malundiro g’abasumba n’ebisulo by’endiga.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a617e4909dcafd482a2",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Olubalama lw’ennyanja luliba lwa kitundu ky’ennyumba ya Yuda ekyasigalawo\n    era we banaalundiranga,\n  ne mu nnyumba za Asukulooni\n    mwe banaagalamiranga akawungeezi.\n  Mukama Katonda waabwe alibalabirira,\n    n’akomyawo obugagga bwabwe.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a627e4909dcafd482e7",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Mpulidde okuvuma kwa Mowaabu\n    n’okusekerera kw’Abamoni\n  kwe bavumye abantu bange\n    ne batiisatiisa ensi yaabwe.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a627e4909dcafd48340",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Kale nga bwe ndi omulamu,\n    bw’ayogera Mukama Ayinzabyonna, Katonda wa Isirayiri,\n  ddala Mowaabu aliba nga Sodomu,\n    n’abaana ba Amoni nga Ggomola,\n  ekifo emyennyango kye gyemala, n’ebirombe by’omunnyo,\n    amatongo agolubeerera. Balinyagibwa abantu bange abaliba basigaddewo,\n  n’ekitundu ky’eggwanga lyange ekifisseewo kiritwala ensi yaabwe.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a627e4909dcafd4836d",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Eno y’eriba empeera yaabwe olw’amalala gaabwe,\n    kubanga bavumye ne banyooma abantu ba Mukama Ayinzabyonna.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a627e4909dcafd483af",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Mukama aliba wa ntiisa gye bali\n    bw’alizikiriza bakatonda bonna ab’ensi.\n  Amawanga gonna ag’oku mbalama zonna galimusinza,\n    buli muntu ng’asinziira mu nsi ye.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a627e4909dcafd4840c",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Nammwe Abaesiyopiya, mulittibwa n’ekitala kyange.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a627e4909dcafd48440",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Aligololera omukono gwe ku bukiikakkono\n    n’azikiriza Obwasuli;\n  n’afuula Nineeve amatongo\n    era ekikalu ng’eddungu.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a627e4909dcafd484a4",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Ente n’endiga zinaagalamiranga wakati mu kyo,\n    n’ensolo zonna eza buli kika:\n  ekiwuugulu era ne nnamunnungu\n    banaasulanga ku mpagi zaakyo.\n  Amaloboozi gaabyo ganaawulikikanga mu madirisa;\n    kafakalimbo ajjudde mu miryango,\n    n’emikiikiro egy’emivule giryelulwa.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a627e4909dcafd48501",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.2.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3ced3",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.2",
        "content": "Kino kye kibuga ekya kyetwala,\n    ekyayogeranga mu mutima gwakyo nti,\n    Nze we ndi, tewali mulala wabula nze:\n  nga kifuuse bifulukwa,\n    ekifo ensolo ez’omu nsiko we zigalamira!\n  Buli muntu akiyitako aneesoozanga\n    n’akinyoomoola.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 2:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a637e4909dcafd4870b",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf1f",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Zikisanze ekibuga ekijooga,\n    ekijeemu era ekyonoonefu!",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 3:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a637e4909dcafd48723",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf1f",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Tekigondera ddoboozi lya Mukama,\n    wadde okukkiriza okubuulirirwa;\n  tekyesiga Mukama;\n    wadde okusemberera Katonda waakyo.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 3:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a637e4909dcafd48762",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf1f",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Abakungu baakyo mpologoma eziwuluguma,\n    era n’abalamuzi baakyo misege gya kiro,\n    bakirimululu abatafissaawo kantu.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 3:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a637e4909dcafd487ad",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf1f",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Bannabbi baakyo si ba buvunaanyizibwa\n    era ba nkwe;\n  bakabona baakyo baweebuusizza ekifo ekitukuvu,\n    era bamenya amateeka.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 3:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a637e4909dcafd487e7",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf1f",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Mukama ali wakati mu kyo, mutuukirivu\n    era tasobya.\n  Buli nkya alamula mu bwenkanya,\n    era buli lukya talemwa;\n    naye atali mutuukirivu taswala.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 3:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a637e4909dcafd48854",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf1f",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "“Nsanyizzaawo amawanga,\n    era ebigo byabwe bifufuggaziddwa;\n  nzisizza enguudo zaabwe,\n    ne wataba ayitamu.\n  Ebibuga byabwe bizikiridde,\n    ne watabaawo muntu n’omu abeeramu.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 3:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a637e4909dcafd4887e",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf1f",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Nagamba eri ekibuga nti,\n    ‘Ddala onontya,\n    era onokkiriza okubuulirirwa.’\n  Ennyumba zaakyo tezandimaliddwawo,\n    n’ebibonerezo byange byonna tebyandimutuuseeko.\n  Naye beesunganga nnyo\n    okukola ebitasaana mu byonna bye baakolanga.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 3:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a637e4909dcafd488e2",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "ZEP.3.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "ZEP",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e22c35ce9345aa3cf1f",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "ZEP",
            "id": "ZEP.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Noolwekyo munnindirire,” bw’ayogera Mukama.\n    Olunaku lwe ndiyimirira ne ntegeeza byonna\n  kubanga mmaliridde okukuŋŋaanya amawanga,\n    ndireeta obwakabaka wamu\n  okubayiwako obusungu bwange,\n    n’ekiruyi kyange kyonna.\n  Omuliro ogw’obuggya bwange\n    gulisaanyaawo ensi yonna.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 3:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.3.mp3"
    },
    {
