            "book": "62661e21c35ce9345aa3ce26"
        },
        "chapterId": "ZEP.3",
        "content": "Mu biro ebyo ndibakuŋŋaanya;\n    mu kiseera ekyo ndibazza eka.\n  Weewaawo ndibawa ekitiibwa n’ettendo\n    mu mawanga gonna ag’omu nsi zonna,\n  bwe ndikomyawo obugagga bwammwe\n    nga mulaba,”\n    bw’ayogera Mukama.",
        "reference": "Zeffaniya 3:20",
        "verseNumber": "20",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/ZEP/ZEP.3.mp3"
